   ],
   "raw_wpm": 231.1,
   "speech_wpm": 172.5,
   "squeeze_saved_s": 2.69
  },
  "boundary_basis": "exact -- per-beat renders atempo-stretched then concatenated",
  "beats": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "id": "hurricane_forget_it",
    "beat": "HOOK",
    "line": "You know how a hurricane shoves you flat across open ground. Remember that. It is nothing.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.92,
    "dur": 5.92,
    "words": 16,
    "wav": "_v2beats/001.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "id": "name_the_planet",
    "beat": "REVEAL",
    "line": "This is WASP-127b. A gas giant, far too close to its own star. And it is almost nothing.",
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 14.454,
    "dur": 8.454,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/002.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 3,
    "id": "fastest_winds",
    "beat": "DATA",
    "line": "The fastest winds ever measured on an exoplanet. Thousands of kilometers per hour, hour after hour.",
    "start": 14.534,
    "end": 21.774,
    "dur": 7.24,
    "words": 16,
    "wav": "_v2beats/003.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 4,
    "id": "never_land",
    "beat": "DATA",
    "line": "They cross the entire planet without ever touching down anywhere. Nothing like that should hold together.",
    "start": 21.854,
    "end": 28.074,
    "dur": 6.22,
    "words": 16,
    "wav": "_v2beats/004.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 5,
    "id": "almost_empty",
    "beat": "DATA",
    "line": "And inside all that fury, the planet is almost empty. One of the lowest densities ever measured.",
    "start": 28.154,
    "end": 34.718,
    "dur": 6.564,
    "words": 17,
    "wav": "_v2beats/005.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 6,
    "id": "nothing_inside",
    "beat": "PIVOT",
    "line": "A giant with nothing inside it, screaming at thousands of kilometers per hour. You cannot stand on that.",
    "start": 34.798,
    "end": 41.367,
    "dur": 6.57,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/006.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 7,
    "id": "read_the_star",
    "beat": "METHOD",
    "line": "So you do what astronomers do. You read the star's light instead of standing out in the wind.",
    "start": 41.447,
    "end": 46.56,
    "dur": 5.113,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/007.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 8,
    "id": "swallowed_colors",
    "beat": "METHOD",
    "line": "You map the atmosphere by watching which colors of starlight get swallowed on the way in.",
    "start": 46.64,
    "end": 51.54,
    "dur": 4.9,
    "words": 16,
    "wav": "_v2beats/008.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 9,
    "id": "missing_tells_you",
    "beat": "MECHANISM",
    "line": "Whatever colors are missing, exactly, tell you what is standing up there in the dark.",
    "start": 51.62,
    "end": 56.627,
    "dur": 5.007,
    "words": 15,
    "wav": "_v2beats/009.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 10,
    "id": "water_leaving",
    "beat": "REVEAL",
    "line": "Water. Leaving. Upward, fast, and not falling back down. Just going out, past the edge of everything.",
    "start": 56.707,
    "end": 63.435,
    "dur": 6.728,
    "words": 17,
    "wav": "_v2beats/010.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 11,
    "id": "grains_high_above",
    "beat": "REVEAL",
    "line": "And a thin haze of small grains, floating far too high above the top of the cloud deck.",
    "start": 63.515,
    "end": 68.754,
    "dur": 5.239,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/011.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 12,
    "id": "throwing_its_away",
    "beat": "PIVOT",
    "line": "That is not a planet holding its air. That is a planet throwing it away.",
    "start": 68.834,
    "end": 73.198,
    "dur": 4.364,
    "words": 15,
    "wav": "_v2beats/012.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 13,
    "id": "leak_no_bottom",
    "beat": "LOADED",
    "line": "The air does not come back. Your sky has a leak, and that leak has no bottom at all.",
    "start": 73.278,
    "end": 78.033,
    "dur": 4.755,
    "words": 19,
    "wav": "_v2beats/013.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 14,
    "id": "too_far_to_help",
    "beat": "CLOSE",
    "line": "You are watching it from far too away to help. That is the whole story of this world.",
    "start": 78.113,
    "end": 83.466,
    "dur": 5.353,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/014.wav"
   }
  ],
  "render_s": 0.9
 },
 {
  "segment": "gliese436b",
  "wav_path": "v2_audio.wav",
  "duration_s": 83.46,
  "sample_rate": 24000,
  "word_count": 237,
  "speech_s": 82.74,
  "gap_s": 0.08,
  "wpm": 170.4,
  "pause_frac": 0.009,
  "on_target": true,
  "params": {
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "temperature": 0.8,
   "target_wpm": 170.0,
   "nominal_gap_s": 0.08,
   "pause_squeeze_above_s": 0.16,
   "pause_squeeze_to_s": 0.07,
   "bright_shelf_hz": 3500,
   "bright_shelf_db": 3.0,
   "tempo_factors": [
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725,
    0.725
   ],
   "raw_wpm": 236.5,
   "speech_wpm": 171.9,
   "squeeze_saved_s": 4.52
  },
  "boundary_basis": "exact -- per-beat renders atempo-stretched then concatenated",
  "beats": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "id": "hook_burning_ice",
    "beat": "HOOK",
    "line": "Here is a planet made of ice.\nAnd it is on fire, and it does not melt.\nThis is Gliese 436 b.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 8.191,
    "dur": 8.191,
    "words": 22,
    "wav": "_v2beats/001.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "id": "world_size",
    "beat": "THE WORLD",
    "line": "It is about the size of Neptune.\nA giant world, made almost entirely of water.",
    "start": 8.271,
    "end": 13.977,
    "dur": 5.706,
    "words": 15,
    "wav": "_v2beats/002.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 3,
    "id": "hook_no_sense",
    "beat": "THE PARADOX",
    "line": "Now here is the part that makes no sense.\nIce should melt. That is what ice does.",
    "start": 14.057,
    "end": 19.78,
    "dur": 5.723,
    "words": 17,
    "wav": "_v2beats/003.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 4,
    "id": "pressure_and_heat",
    "beat": "THE CRUSH",
    "line": "But this ice is under crushing pressure from its own gravity.\nAnd its star keeps cooking it from close range.\nAll of that pressure and heat at once.",
    "start": 19.86,
    "end": 29.117,
    "dur": 9.258,
    "words": 28,
    "wav": "_v2beats/004.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 5,
    "id": "no_choice",
    "beat": "THE TRAP",
    "line": "The water never gets to choose.\nIt cannot be solid. It cannot be liquid.\nIt is something in between.",
    "start": 29.197,
    "end": 35.203,
    "dur": 6.005,
    "words": 19,
    "wav": "_v2beats/005.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 6,
    "id": "supercritical",
    "beat": "THE STATE",
    "line": "Scientists call it supercritical.\nA supercritical fluid. No boundary between ice and steam.",
    "start": 35.283,
    "end": 41.596,
    "dur": 6.313,
    "words": 13,
    "wav": "_v2beats/006.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 7,
    "id": "burning_torch",
    "beat": "THE SURFACE",
    "line": "Imagine ice that flows like water and burns like a torch.\nThat is the surface of this world.\nYou could not stand on it. You could not swim in it.\nIt would eat through your ship.",
    "start": 41.676,
    "end": 52.307,
    "dur": 10.631,
    "words": 36,
    "wav": "_v2beats/007.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 8,
    "id": "losing_mass",
    "beat": "THE ESCAPE",
    "line": "And this world is not alone out here.\nIt has lost a lot of mass over its life.\nHydrogen and helium are escaping from it, right now.",
    "start": 52.387,
    "end": 60.712,
    "dur": 8.325,
    "words": 27,
    "wav": "_v2beats/008.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 9,
    "id": "glowing_tail",
    "beat": "THE TAIL",
    "line": "They stream away in a long comet-like tail.\nAnd that tail glows. It glows in the dark.",
    "start": 60.791,
    "end": 67.35,
    "dur": 6.558,
    "words": 17,
    "wav": "_v2beats/009.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 10,
    "id": "closing_impossible",
    "beat": "FATE",
    "line": "So picture a burning-ice planet dragging a glowing tail of gas behind it.\nA hot, dense, impossible world, screaming around its star.\nIt is one of the strangest things in the galaxy.\nAnd it is just sitting there. Burning its ice. Quietly. Forever.",
    "start": 67.43,
    "end": 83.46,
    "dur": 16.03,
    "words": 43,
    "wav": "_v2beats/010.wav"
   }
  ],
  "render_s": 0.6
 },
 {
  "segment": "koi55",
  "wav_path": "v2_audio.wav",
  "duration_s": 87.674,
  "sample_rate": 24000,
  "word_count": 249,
  "speech_s": 86.794,
  "gap_s": 0.08,
  "wpm": 170.4,
  "pause_frac": 0.01,
  "on_target": true,
  "params": {
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "temperature": 0.8,
   "target_wpm": 170.0,
   "nominal_gap_s": 0.08,
   "pause_squeeze_above_s": 0.16,
   "pause_squeeze_to_s": 0.07,
   "bright_shelf_hz": 3500,
   "bright_shelf_db": 3.0,
   "tempo_factors": [
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492,
    0.7492
   ],
   "raw_wpm": 229.2,
   "speech_wpm": 172.1,
   "squeeze_saved_s": 4.38
  },
  "boundary_basis": "exact -- per-beat renders atempo-stretched then concatenated",
  "beats": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "id": "hook_closest_orbit",
    "beat": "HOOK",
    "line": "This planet sits closer to its star than any planet we have found.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.134,
    "dur": 4.134,
    "words": 13,
    "wav": "_v2beats/001.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "id": "hook_five_hours",
    "beat": "THE_CLOCK",
    "line": "One year up there lasts about five hours and forty minutes.\nSunrise, noon, sunset, gone. Over and over.",
    "start": 4.214,
    "end": 11.593,
    "dur": 7.379,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/002.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 3,
    "id": "hook_breath",
    "beat": "TIME_SCALE",
    "line": "The star swings around again before this sentence ends.\nIts whole life happens inside one breath of yours.",
    "start": 11.673,
    "end": 18.687,
    "dur": 7.014,
    "words": 18,
    "wav": "_v2beats/003.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 4,
    "id": "bare_rock_world",
    "beat": "THE_WORLD",
    "line": "It is a bare rock. No air. No ocean. No weather.\nNothing there has been alive in a very long while.\nJust a charred shell with a dead core inside.",
    "start": 18.767,
    "end": 28.536,
    "dur": 9.769,
    "words": 30,
    "wav": "_v2beats/004.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 5,
    "id": "the_boiling",
    "beat": "THE_BURN",
    "line": "Its star is enormous, and close, and very hot.\nIt has been boiling this rock since they formed.\nWhatever atmosphere it ever had was taken off years ago.",
    "start": 28.616,
    "end": 38.855,
    "dur": 10.239,
    "words": 28,
    "wav": "_v2beats/005.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 6,
    "id": "melted_and_hardened",
    "beat": "CHARRED",
    "line": "The surface has been melted, drained, hardened again.\nIt is a cinder. The catalog has nothing closer.",
    "start": 38.935,
    "end": 45.031,
    "dur": 6.096,
    "words": 17,
    "wav": "_v2beats/006.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 7,
    "id": "how_we_found_it",
    "beat": "THE_SEARCH",
    "line": "Kepler only ever saw a shadow. Every five hours, forty minutes.\nIt dipped, and the star dimmed, and dipped again.\nKOI-55 is a number. Nobody gave it a better name.",
    "start": 45.111,
    "end": 55.023,
    "dur": 9.912,
    "words": 30,
    "wav": "_v2beats/007.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 8,
    "id": "the_spiral_in",
    "beat": "THE_FALL",
    "line": "It is falling inward, one orbit at a time.\nEvery pass takes it closer to the surface.\nThere is nothing left underneath to fall toward.",
    "start": 55.103,
    "end": 62.454,
    "dur": 7.351,
    "words": 25,
    "wav": "_v2beats/008.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 9,
    "id": "it_survived_being_eaten",
    "beat": "SURVIVOR",
    "line": "Here is the part that should keep you awake.\nThis world may already have been swallowed once.\nIt may already have survived being eaten.",
    "start": 62.534,
    "end": 71.753,
    "dur": 9.219,
    "words": 24,
    "wav": "_v2beats/009.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 10,
    "id": "disturbing_part",
    "beat": "THE_TWIST",
    "line": "That is what makes it disturbing. Not that it dies.\nThat it is allowed to die twice.",
    "start": 71.833,
    "end": 76.781,
    "dur": 4.947,
    "words": 17,
    "wav": "_v2beats/010.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 11,
    "id": "the_last_pass",
    "beat": "FATE",
    "line": "The next pass will not be a pass.\nIt will be the last one.",
    "start": 76.861,
    "end": 80.625,
    "dur": 3.764,
    "words": 14,
    "wav": "_v2beats/011.wav"
   },
   {
    "n": 12,
    "id": "outro_cinder",
    "beat": "OUTRO",
    "line": "KOI-55. Five hours and forty minutes a year.\nOne fall left. Nothing is coming back.",
    "start": 80.705,
    "end": 87.674,
    "dur": 6.969,
    "words": 15,
    "wav": "_v2beats/012.wav"
   }
  ],
  "render_s": 0.7
 },
 {
  "segment": "ltt9779b",
  "wav_path": "v2_audio.wav",
  "duration_s": 82.33,
  "sample_rate": 24000,
  "word_count": 234,
  "speech_s": 81.29,
  "gap_s": 0.08,
  "wpm": 170.5,
  "pause_frac": 0.013,
  "on_target": true,
  "params": {
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "temperature": 0.8,
   "target_wpm": 170.0,
   "nominal_gap_s": 0.08,
   "pause_squeeze_above_s": 0.16,
   "pause_squeeze_to_s": 0.07,
   "bright_shelf_hz": 3500,
   "bright_shelf_db": 3.0,
   "tempo_factors": [
    0.7676,
    0.7676,
    0.7676,
    0.7676,
    0.7676,
